{"id": "A4", "category": "A", "question": "It's going to rain on our trip. Is it OK to cook with the Ember 2 inside the tent?", "expect": {"status": "answered", "facts": ["\\b(no|never|not)\\b"], "sources": [{"source": "manual-ember-2-stove.pdf", "page": 2}]}, "llm_mode": "live", "request_id": "2cf9428486", "mode": "baseline", "status": "baseline", "answer": "No, it is not safe to cook with the Ember 2 inside the tent or in any enclosed space. The stove produces carbon monoxide, which can be deadly. Always use the Ember 2 outdoors and keep it at least 3 feet away from tents, trees, and other flammable objects.", "reason": "", "citations": [], "rejected_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"chunk_id": "manual-ember-2-stove.pdf#p2#c0", "label": "manual-ember-2-stove.pdf p.2", "score": 0.5256}, {"chunk_id": "manual-ember-2-stove.pdf#p1#c0", "label": "manual-ember-2-stove.pdf p.1", "score": 0.4665}, {"chunk_id": "manual-ember-2-stove.pdf#p3#c0", "label": "manual-ember-2-stove.pdf p.3", "score": 0.4247}, {"chunk_id": "spare-parts.md#s-parts-you-can-order#c0", "label": "spare-parts.md > Parts you can order", "score": 0.4032}, {"chunk_id": "manual-drift-20-sleeping-bag.pdf#p2#c0", "label": "manual-drift-20-sleeping-bag.pdf p.2", "score": 0.3579}], "top_score": 0.5256, "model": "gpt-4o-mini", "ms": 1563}
{"id": "A5", "category": "A", "question": "How should I wash my Drift 20 sleeping bag?", "expect": {"status": "answered", "facts": ["cold", "front"], "sources": [{"source": "manual-drift-20-sleeping-bag.pdf", "page": 2}]}, "llm_mode": "live", "request_id": "9071954015", "mode": "baseline", "status": "baseline", "answer": "To wash your Drift 20 sleeping bag, follow these steps:\n\n1. Use a front-loading washing machine only, as top-loading machines with an agitator can damage the bag.\n2. Set the machine to a gentle cycle and use cold water.\n3. Use a mild, non-detergent soap for washing.\n4. After washing, tumble dry the sleeping bag on low heat with two clean tennis balls to help break up any clumps.\n\nMake sure to dry the bag completely before storing it to prevent mildew.", "reason": "", "citations": [], "rejected_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"chunk_id": "manual-drift-20-sleeping-bag.pdf#p2#c0", "label": "manual-drift-20-sleeping-bag.pdf p.2", "score": 0.667}, {"chunk_id": "manual-drift-20-sleeping-bag.pdf#p1#c0", "label": "manual-drift-20-sleeping-bag.pdf p.1", "score": 0.5053}, {"chunk_id": "care-and-storage.md#s-after-every-trip#c0", "label": "care-and-storage.md > After every trip", "score": 0.4588}, {"chunk_id": "manual-glacier-45-cooler.pdf#p2#c0", "label": "manual-glacier-45-cooler.pdf p.2", "score": 0.3334}, {"chunk_id": "care-and-storage.md#s-care-and-storage#c0", "label": "care-and-storage.md > Care and Storage", "score": 0.2513}], "top_score": 0.667, "model": "gpt-4o-mini", "ms": 1753}
{"id": "A6", "category": "A", "question": "My lantern stopped turning on after two months. How do I make a warranty claim?", "expect": {"status": "answered", "facts": ["warranty@cinderpeak\\.example"], "sources": [{"source": "warranty.pdf", "page": 3}]}, "llm_mode": "live", "request_id": "9788c27a80", "mode": "baseline", "status": "baseline", "answer": "To make a warranty claim for your Halo LED Lantern, please follow these steps:\n\n1. **Email**: Send an email to warranty@cinderpeak.example.\n2. **Include Information**: In your email, provide your order number, a short description of the problem (in this case, that the lantern stopped turning on), and attach photos of the issue if possible.\n3. **Wait for a Response**: You can expect a reply within 2 business days.\n\nIf your claim is approved, Cinderpeak Outdoor will either repair the item, replace it, or refund your purchase price, and they will cover shipping both ways for approved claims.", "reason": "", "citations": [], "rejected_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"chunk_id": "warranty.pdf#p2#c0", "label": "warranty.pdf p.2", "score": 0.4722}, {"chunk_id": "manual-halo-lantern.pdf#p2#c0", "label": "manual-halo-lantern.pdf p.2", "score": 0.4517}, {"chunk_id": "warranty.pdf#p3#c0", "label": "warranty.pdf p.3", "score": 0.4378}, {"chunk_id": "care-and-storage.md#s-batteries#c0", "label": "care-and-storage.md > Batteries", "score": 0.4278}, {"chunk_id": "manual-halo-lantern.pdf#p1#c0", "label": "manual-halo-lantern.pdf p.1", "score": 0.408}], "top_score": 0.4722, "model": "gpt-4o-mini", "ms": 1883}
